Semantics suite: matcher pitfalls (design §4.2, §14.1).
-- suffix-apex --
in: https://example.com/?hostonly=1&a=1
want: https://example.com/?a=1
-- suffix-sub --
in: https://a.b.example.com/?hostonly=1
want: https://a.b.example.com/
-- suffix-not-substring --
note: *.example.com vs badexample.com
in: https://badexample.com/?hostonly=1
want: unchanged
-- suffix-not-in-userinfo --
in: https://www.example.com@evil.example.net/?hostonly=1
want: unchanged
-- suffix-not-in-query --
in: https://evil.example.net/?u=https://www.example.com/&hostonly=1
want: unchanged
-- idn-punycode-pattern --
note: the pattern is written in punycode; a Unicode host matches through its view; output verbatim
in: https://bücher.example/?idn=1&a=1
want: https://bücher.example/?a=1
-- idn-punycode-input --
in: https://xn--bcher-kva.example/?idn=1
want: https://xn--bcher-kva.example/
-- idn-uppercase --
in: https://BÜCHER.example/?idn=1
want: https://BÜCHER.example/
-- glob-literal-question-mark --
in: https://qm.example.com/a?b=1&x=2
want: https://qm.example.com/a?b=1
-- glob-question-mark-not-wildcard --
in: https://qm.example.com/ab?x=2
want: unchanged
-- glob-question-mark-needs-query --
in: https://qm.example.com/a?x=2&b=1
want: unchanged
-- port-default-443 --
in: https://port.example.com/?p443=1
want: https://port.example.com/
-- port-explicit-443 --
in: https://port.example.com:443/?p443=1
want: https://port.example.com:443/
-- port-other --
in: https://port.example.com:8443/?p443=1
want: unchanged
-- port-http-default --
note: the pattern's scheme is https
in: http://port.example.com:443/?p443=1
want: unchanged
-- suffix-ipv4 --
note: *.0.0.1 never matches an IP by subdomain
in: http://10.0.0.1/?ipx=1&utm_source=x
want: http://10.0.0.1/?ipx=1
-- ipv6-global-only --
in: http://[2001:db8::1]/?ipx=1&utm_source=x
want: http://[2001:db8::1]/?ipx=1
-- label-apex --
in: https://amazon.com/?lbl=1
want: https://amazon.com/
-- label-cc-sld --
in: https://www.amazon.co.uk/?lbl=1
want: https://www.amazon.co.uk/
-- label-sub --
in: https://smile.amazon.de/?lbl=1
want: https://smile.amazon.de/
-- label-not-other-site --
in: https://amazon.evil.example/?lbl=1
want: unchanged
-- label-not-private-github --
note: DR-F7: ICANN site of amazon.github.io is github.io
in: https://amazon.github.io/?lbl=1
want: unchanged
-- label-not-private-blogspot --
in: https://amazon.blogspot.com/?lbl=1
want: unchanged
-- label-not-com-be --
note: com.be is not a public suffix (§4.2 limitation)
in: https://www.amazon.com.be/?lbl=1
want: unchanged
-- exclude --
in: https://ex.example.net/a?exparam=1
want: https://ex.example.net/a
-- exclude-applies --
in: https://ex.example.net/keep/a?exparam=1
want: unchanged
